  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FIRMA PROJECT USAID-Sida implemented by Cardno - SME development FIRMA</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">FIRMA PROJECT USAID-Sida implemented by Cardno</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FIRMA is a 5 year 19MUSD project co financed between Sweden and USA.  Sida orignial decision in 2008 was for 48.6MSEK.  The project was     cost extended in July 2014 by 9 months and 1.2MEK.  During the 5 year Sept 2009-Sept 2014 lifespan the project supported SME growth and job creation in industrial sectors of BiH (metal, tourism, wood) During   the extension the project assist SMEs affected by May 2014 floods.</narrative>
